### 1. OBTENER todos los productos tech desde DummyJSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/external/tech
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. BUSCAR productos tech en DummyJSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/external/search?q=iphone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar laptops
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/external/search?q=laptop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar tablets
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/external/search?q=tablet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. IMPORTAR productos tech a la base de datos (SOLO ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import/tech
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryIds": [1]
}

### 4. OBTENER productos LOCALES ya guardados en la base de datos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/local
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. OBTENER un producto local por ID (CORRECTO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/local/by-id?id=47
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
